"CPU Profiler" = "CPU 性能分析";
"Sampling" = "采样";
"About this profiler" = "关于此分析器";
"Hot spots" = "热点";
"Start sampling" = "开始采样";
"Refresh hot spots" = "刷新热点";
"Load a game first: sampling only works while a game is running." = "请先载入游戏：仅在游戏运行时才能采样。";
"Sampling started. Play for a few seconds, then tap Refresh hot spots." = "采样已开始。游玩几秒后点“刷新热点”。";
"Could not start sampling (is a game running?)." = "无法开始采样（游戏正在运行吗？）。";
"No samples yet. Start sampling, play for a few seconds, then tap Refresh hot spots." = "还没有样本。开始采样，游玩几秒后点“刷新热点”。";
"Updated %@" = "已更新 %@";
"Sampling is cumulative: every guest step since you tapped Start sampling contributes, so Refresh shows totals, not a recent window." = "采样是累计的：从点“开始采样”起的每个 guest 指令步都会计入，因此“刷新”显示的是累计总量，而不是最近一段时间。";
"The runtime never names guest functions: hot spots are raw guest PCs (thread 0xPC hits). Match an address against the symbol map of the game's libgame.a (the AOT GamePack build); addresses from a different build of that pack will not match." = "运行时不提供 guest 函数名：热点是原始 guest PC（线程 0xPC 命中次数）。请把地址与游戏 libgame.a（AOT GamePack 构建产物）的符号表对应；不同构建的地址无法匹配。";
"The profiler stays on for the current game load and adds a small cost per guest step; it is for diagnosis only. Unload the game or relaunch the app to stop it." = "分析器在当前这次游戏载入期间保持开启，每个 guest 指令步会有少量开销；仅用于诊断。卸载游戏或重启 App 即可停止。";
"Sampling is on. Reopen Settings later: the counts keep accumulating for this load." = "采样已开启。稍后重新打开设置：本次载入期间计数会持续累计。";
